<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TaskUp</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <main class="shell hero-shell">
        <section class="hero-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">TaskUp</p>
            <h1>Calm, focused task management.</h1>
            <p class="hero-copy">A minimalist workspace for tracking work, clearing your head, and getting through the day with less noise.</p>
            <div class="button-row">
                <a class="button button-primary" href="/signup">Create account</a>
                <a class="button button-secondary" href="/signin">Sign in</a>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-grid">
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <h2>Fast capture</h2>
                    <p>Add tasks in seconds and keep momentum going.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <h2>Simple focus</h2>
                    <p>See only what matters in a clean, distraction-free layout.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <h2>Stay organized</h2>
                    <p>Track pending, completed, and shared tasks from one place.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
